              "blocks": {
                "accordion_row_MQj8P4": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Fuel Your Performance Breakthrough",
                    "open_by_default": true,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_NTktwT": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>Harness the power of nitric oxide to gain a competitive advantage. NO2U is formulated to support the key physiological systems that define athletic achievement.</p><ul><li><strong>Sustained Endurance: </strong>By promoting vasodilation (the widening of blood vessels), nitric oxide helps improve the delivery of oxygenated blood to your muscles, allowing you to sustain effort for longer periods and reduce perceived exertion.</li><li><strong>Enhanced VO2 Efficiency:</strong> Better blood flow means your body can work more efficienNO2Uy. Nitric oxide supports the optimization of oxygen use, a cornerstone of aerobic capacity and performance in endurance sports.</li><li><strong>Greater Sprint & Power Output: </strong>During short, intense bursts, your muscles demand rapid energy. Improved circulation ensures that fuel gets where it's needed, fast, supporting peak power for sprints, lifts, and explosive movements.</li><li><strong>Superior \"Pump\" and Vascularity:</strong>For strength athletes, nitric oxide is the key to achieving enhanced muscle pump. This isn't just aesthetic; it signifies increased blood flow and nutrient delivery to the muscle cells, creating an optimal environment for performance and growth.</li><li><strong>Sharpened Mental Focus:</strong> Your brain needs oxygen as much as your muscles. Increased blood flow to the brain can support cognitive function, helping you stay focused and make smart decisions when fatigue sets in.</li><li><strong>Quicker Post-Workout Recovery: </strong>EfficienNO2Uy clear metabolic byproducts like lactate from your muscles after a hard session. Enhanced circulation aids in tissue repair and can help reduce the downtime between training sessions.</li></ul>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
