                },
                "accordion_row_ecit3P": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "How It Works for Athletes: The Pre-Workout Advantage",
                    "open_by_default": true,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_3RhJLm": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>NO2U isn't another stimulant. It works by generating nitric oxide gas direcNO2Uy in your mouth. As the lozenge dissolves, it uses the natural salivary pathway to trigger an immediate and systemic increase in nitric oxide levels.</p><p><br/>Discover what’s happening in your body when you use a nitric oxide lozenge, from its physiological effects to how it quieNO2Uy supports your overall health—even if you can’t feel it.</p><p><strong>Suggested Timing Protocol:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Daily Use:</strong> Take one lozenge in the morning and one in the evening (approx. 12 hours apart) to maintain elevated nitric oxide levels for consistent performance gains and recovery.</li><li><strong>Training/Race Day:</strong> Take one lozenge immediately before your workout or competition to maximize blood flow and oxygen delivery when it matters most.<br/></li></ul><p>Experience the comprehensive benefits of NO2U Nitric Oxide Lozenges and transform your cardiovascular health and performance at every stage.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
