              "name": "t:names.description",
              "settings": {
                "css_class": "",
                "text": "<p><strong>Vitamin C: </strong>Provides essential antioxidant support to combat exercise-induced oxidative stress and boosts immune health to keep you in peak condition.</p><p><strong>Magnesium: </strong>Reduces tiredness and fatigue while supporting muscle function for optimal physical performance and recovery.</p><p><strong>NO2U Proprietary Blend</strong></p><ul><li>Magnesium Ascorbate</li><li>Sodium Nitrite</li></ul><p><strong>Stevia:</strong> A natural ingredient with antimicrobial and antioxidant properties that help protect your body and support overall health.</p><p><strong>Monk Fruit Extract:</strong> A natural ingredient with antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties that aids in recovery by helping to protect against free radicals and reduce inflammation.<br/><br/><strong>Other Ingredients</strong></p><p>Mannitol, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Dextrin, Natural Flavors, Croscarmellose Sodium, Maltodextrin, Stearic Acid, Vegetable Stearate, Food Starch - Modified, Starch, Silica, Citric Acid<br/><br/><br/></p>",
